    private warrants; (c) 6,885,632 &nbsp;prior warrants, and (d) 7,500,000 Lind warrants.</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
