    <TD>137,831,816 ordinary shares (as of August 31, 2023), including 13,130,252 shares issuable upon exercise of the Shayna Warrants,
which are issuable upon conversion of the Shayna Loans.</TD></TR>
</TABLE>

<P STYLE="margin: 0">&nbsp;</P>

</DIV>

<P STYLE="margin: 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="margin: 0"></P>

