<TD STYLE="text-align: left; width: 0.25in"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 0.25in; text-align: left">&#9679;</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: left">We have issued an aggregate of 2,844,219 ordinary shares
pursuant to the exercise of share options by our employees, directors and consultants.</TD>
